buzzs-rust-php-project is a Rust port of php-src
(https://github.com/php/php-src). Most of its source files are translations
of php-src C files and remain derivative works of them: the copyright in
those files is shared between the php-src authors (The PHP Group and
Contributors, Zend Technologies, and the individual authors named in each
C file's header) and the authors of the port. Parts of this repository are
derived from third-party code bundled with php-src that is NOT covered by
the license below; see THIRD_PARTY.md and the LICENSES/ directory.

Except where THIRD_PARTY.md or a file's header says otherwise, the
following license applies:

